                <!--  二、	立项依据（可加页） 开始-->
                <div class="c-base-info">
                    <h4 class="c-base-info-title">
                        二、	立项依据（可加页）
                    </h4>
                    <div class="c-base-info-content">
                        <table class="c-lxyj-table">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （一）研究目的
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">响应国家战略需求<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">紧扣国家“低空经济”与“农业新质生产力”政策，推动无人机技术在智慧农业领域的深度应用，填补植物工厂智能化管理技术的空白。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">解决行业技术瓶颈<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">传统植物工厂依赖人工巡检或固定传感器网络，存在监测盲区多、数据维度单一、响应速度慢等问题。本项目通过自主测绘系统实现全区域、多维度、实时动态监测，有效提升管理效率。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">降低应用门槛<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">基于低成本硬件设计和开源软件开发，降低中小型植物工厂的技术准入门槛，为智慧农业的普及化提供高性价比解决方案。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">4. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">推动产业转型升级<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">项目的实施预计能使植物工厂的管理效率提升<span>40%</span>，资源浪费减少<span>25%</span>，为农业数字化转型提供技术支持，助力我国农业科技走向国际前沿。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （二）研究内容
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">硬件开发<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">传感器适配与标定：优化<span>TOF</span>传感器的测距精度，研究复杂环境下的信号衰减规律；开发适应植物工厂多层架结构的动态标定方法。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">通信与续航优化：设计基于<span>ESP32</span>的低功耗通信方案，利用深度休眠模式实现单次续航时间提升至<span>0.5</span>小时以上。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">软件算法研发<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">SLAM</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">与导航算法：开发轻量化同步定位与建图算法，实现无<span>GPS</span>环境下的厘米级定位；优化飞行路径规划与避障算法，适应复杂植被环境。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">数据融合与建模：集成<span>TOF</span>点云、多光谱影像及温湿度数据，构建作物三维生长模型；开发生长趋势预测与异常检测算法，提升环境监控的智能化水平。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">系统集成与验证<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">实验验证：在模拟植物工厂环境中，测试系统的测绘精度、避障性能及数据回传稳定性。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">场景化应用：结合实际植物工厂需求，开展示范应用，验证系统在精准施肥、病虫害监测等场景下的适用性。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （三）国、内外研究现状和发展动态
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">国内研究现状<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术应用：国内农业无人机已在大田作物监测、病虫害防控等场景广泛应用，但在封闭环境的植物工厂中仍处于探索阶段，缺乏成熟的自主测绘方案。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">政策支持：<span>2025</span>年中央一号文件明确提出“农业新质生产力”战略，强调智慧农业与无人机技术的深度融合。多地政府相继出台低空经济专项政策，推动无人机技术在农业领域的产业化。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术瓶颈：<span>TOF</span>传感器在密集植被环境中的信号干扰问题尚未完全解决，低成本嵌入式系统在实时数据处理和建模中的应用仍需深入研究。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">国外研究动态<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">精准农业：欧美国家在多光谱成像与<span>LiDAR</span>测绘领域处于领先地位，但设备成本高、技术门槛高，难以普及到小型农业场景。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">植物工厂创新：日本和荷兰的垂直农场开始试验无人机巡检技术，但主要集中于病虫害检测，未能广泛应用于环境测绘。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术趋势：边缘计算与传感器融合技术的快速发展，为植物工厂的智能化测绘系统提供了新的解决路径。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">发展动态<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">硬件微型化：<span>TOF</span>传感器的成本与体积逐年下降，为无人机小型化与低成本化提供了支持。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">算法开源化：国际开源社区不断发布<span>SLAM</span>、数据融合等相关算法，加速了技术普及。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">政策与资本驱动：国内外资本积极布局农业无人机市场，预计到<span>2025</span>年，全球农业无人机市场规模将突破<span>200</span>亿美元。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （四）创新点与项目特色
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">创新点：<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">设计基于<span>ESP32</span>的低成本自主测绘系统，集成<span>TOF</span>与<span>SLAM</span>算法，满足植物工厂封闭环境的测绘需求。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">提出多源数据融合算法，结合点云建模与多光谱影像，提供作物健康监测与异常识别的智能化解决方案。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">采用轻量化设计与开源开发，降低技术门槛，填补小型植物工厂智能化管理的技术空白。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">项目特色：<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">高性价比：硬件设计采用<span>ESP32</span>与低成本<span>TOF</span>传感器，兼具高精度与经济性。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">可扩展性：模块化硬件接口支持多种传感器快速集成，适配不同场景需求。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">实时性与智能化：结合<span>SLAM</span>与深度学习模型，实现实时避障、环境监测与决策支持。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （五）技术路线、拟解决的问题及预期成果
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">(1)</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术路线<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">本项目以低空经济和农业新质生产力政策为导向，围绕植物工厂高精度环境测绘需求，构建基于<span>TOF</span>传感器和<span>ESP32</span>主控的无人机自主测绘系统，技术路线分为以下四阶段：硬件架构设计、软件算法开发、系统集成与验证、应用场景拓展。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">(2)</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">拟解决的关键问题<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">复杂环境下<span>TOF</span>信号干扰与建模精度问题；<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">多源数据融合及时空对齐难题<span>;</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">3.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">低功耗与实时性兼顾的性能优化<span>;</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">(3)</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">预期成果<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术成果：轻量化自主测绘系统原型、开源代码库。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">应用成果：作物生长周期监测误差≤<span>5%</span>，资源利用率提升<span>30%</span>。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                                （六）项目研究进度安排
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                                <h4><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;">进度安排</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family:" calibri="" light",sans-serif;="" font-weight:normal;"=""></span></strong></h4>

