  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2026.02-2026.06</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="266" valign="top" style="width:199.6pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">在模拟植物工厂环境中完成避障、测绘及能耗测试，优化系统稳定性<span></span></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="142" valign="top" style="width:106.65pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">测试数据集<span>1</span>套，优化版原型机<span>1</span>台<span></span></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style="">
  <td width="65" valign="top" style="width:48.45pt; border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">应用示范与推广</span></strong><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;"></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="93" valign="top" style="width:69.8pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">2026.07-2026.12</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="266" valign="top" style="width:199.6pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">与合作农业企业开展田间试验，生成标准化技术方案<span></span></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width="142" valign="top" style="width:106.65pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; border-right:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">应用案例报告<span>1</span>份，技术白皮书<span>1</span>份<span></span></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</tbody></table>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">&nbsp;</span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （七）已有基础
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj-sub">
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-sub-title">1.与本项目有关的研究积累和已取得的成绩</div>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-sub-contet">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">1. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">研究积累与已有成绩<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">无人机平台开发经验：团队曾参与智能飞行器在智慧农业中的相关项目，掌握多旋翼无人机控制算法及传感器集成技术。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">TOF</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">技术研究：使用了多款<span>TOF</span>传感器，对各类型<span>TOF</span>传感器有了深厚的使用经验。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">植物工厂数据模型：曾使用过<span>YOLO</span>等多款<span>AI</span>模型。<span></span></span></p>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div class="c-lxyj-sub">
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-sub-title">2.已具备的条件，尚缺少的条件及解决方法</div>
                                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-sub-contet">
                                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">已具备条件：<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">硬件：<span>ESP32</span>开发板<span>10</span>套、<span>VL53L5CX</span>传感器<span>5</span>组、无人机飞行平台多台。<span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0cm; text-indent:24.0pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">软件：相关<span>AI</span>视觉等开发配套软件，开源<span>SLAM</span>算法库（<span>MicroSLAM</span>）。<span></span></span></p>

<span style="font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;">植物工厂试验场地：尚未接入规模化种植基地，在国家“乡村振兴”政策的号召下拟通过对接农业企业达到实验环境条件。</span>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>

                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
